03,7504,7505,7506,7507,7508,7509,7510,7511,7512,7513,7514,7515,7516,7517,7518,7519,7520,7521,7522,7523,7524,7525,7526,7527,7528,7529,7530,7531,7532,7533,7534,7535,7536,7537],"projection_sha256":"61049c7ee7336447d487b9a46f8cea81aef880dc316b80ca1691fa56ce0b5023","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang","book_id":"b-nanqishu-040","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-040-zixiang-ws2272748"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005","text":"臨死，啓上曰：「劉寅等入齋檢仗，具如前啓。臣罪旣山海，分甘斧鉞。奉勑遣胡諧之、茹法亮賜重勞，其等至，竟無宣旨，便建旗入津，對城南岸築城守。臣累遣書信喚法亮渡，乞白服相見，其永不肯，羣小懼怖，遂致攻戰，此臣之罪也。臣此月二十五日束身投軍，希還天闕，停宅一月，臣自取盡，可使齊代無殺子之譏，臣免逆父之謗。旣不遂心，今便命盡，臨啓哽塞，知復何陳。」有司奏絕子響屬籍，削爵土，收付廷尉法獄治罪。賜爲蛸氏。諸所連坐，別下考論。贈劉寅侍中，席恭穆輔國將軍、益州刺史，江愈、殷曇粲黃門郎，周彥驍騎將軍。寅字景蕤，高平人也。有文義而學不閑世務。席恭穆，安定焉氏人，關隴豪族。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0008","surface":"劉寅","start":8,"end":10,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0035","surface":"胡諧之","start":35,"end":38,"person_id":"2yz_7xj_cx7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0039","surface":"茹法亮","start":39,"end":42,"person_id":"u4m_so3_3c0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0075","surface":"法亮","start":75,"end":77,"person_id":"u4m_so3_3c0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0175","surface":"子響","start":175,"end":177,"person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_G","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0209","surface":"劉寅","start":209,"end":211,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0214","surface":"席恭穆","start":214,"end":217,"person_id":"2d4